# Generated exports and temporary packages can be large.
# Keep README files and export folders, but ignore generated package payloads by default.
**/08_导出/投稿版/*
**/08_导出/存档版/*
!**/08_导出/投稿版/README.md
!**/08_导出/存档版/README.md
